<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13402"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 04, 2005 - 7:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I LOVE this board...Everyone is so funny and so good spirited amoungst this horror....I wish we could all get together and meet...Tac - I think &#34;barney&#34; fits Fattie Beattie better to...this is some fun huh? <BR>Itty - you are a good sport...I say really really dumb stuff too...you make me smile...as I said before...amoungst the horror<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
