<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13408"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 04, 2005 - 8:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lizzie, I never noticed that there are 333 pages. <BR>I have a softback, however, I was told it only came out in softback...by someone who lives in Doo Dah...but then I remember other posters talking about having the jacket signed vs. the inside signed by Beattie.. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
