<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13458"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 05, 2005 - 5:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK: <BR> <BR>It&#39;s really true. <BR> <BR>Full story later, I&#39;m pressed for time tonight.  I had contact with the case later in a non-priviledged way.   <BR> <BR>The actual story involves the defendant trying to sell the duck to a local farm-wife to get enough money to buy a &#42;fresh&#42; duck. <BR> <BR>Phoenix<!--/Text--></td></tr>
