<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13477"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 06, 2005 - 12:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK OK OK OK OK <BR> <BR>So what happens is in the early 80&#39;s a 911 call is made to the Sedgwick Co. Sheriff--- <BR> <BR>&#40;Pause:refresh martini&#41; <BR> <BR>The caller is a woman who lives on the family farm, whose husband works at Boeing during the day.  They have a small farming operation, corn livestock, chickens etc. <BR> <BR>She says that a man in blue jeans and a work shirt is trying to sell her a duck, or trade what he has for one of her ducks. <BR> <BR>She tells 911 that two things make her suspicious: <BR> <BR>1&#41;  The ducks feet are tied together and it is missing most of it&#39;s feathers around whatever the part of a duck is that duck eggs come out.  [In Kansas on a windy day a duck can lay the same egg twice, but that&#39;s another story] <BR> <BR>2&#41;  The missing feathers seem to have adhered to the crotch of the man&#39;s blue jeans. <BR> <BR>She stalled him, a deputy arrived, he was detained to try to figure out what,if any, crime had been committed. <BR> <BR>After learning that this was the same person who had been apprehended &#34;flagrante delicto&#34; at the Eastborough Duck Pond, some detective decided to do a rape kit on the duck and it was positive.  The man remained silent, there was no way to prove that he was the one who put positive to the duck, and he was  and he was released without prosecution. <BR> <BR>He spent months tryin to find a lawyer who would sue for false imprisonment. <BR> <BR>Phoenix<!--/Text--></td></tr>
